# Editor scaffolding, written by whichever one is open. Nothing here is shared, and
# the Swift extension's launch.json in particular configures the run this project
# does not use: `remotex.app` needs the gateway binary beside it in the bundle, so a
# target launched from .build comes up saying the copy is incomplete. Debug the
# packaged app instead (packaging/macos-viewer/README.md).
